and the Oscar goes to Joaquin Phoenix  joke Joaquin Phoenix finally wins an  Oscar after three previous nominations  for gladiator walked the line and the  master the forty five-year-old picked up  the Best Actor trophy for his  performance in Joker beating out fellow  nominees Antonio Banderas Leonardo  DiCaprio Adam driver and Jonathan price  comes so much gratitude right now and I  do not feel elevated above any my fellow  nominees or anyone in this room because  we share the same love that the love of  film I don't know what I'd be without it  Joaquin went on to say that his greatest  gift has been the opportunity to use his  platform for the voiceless that to get  times we feel or were made to feel that  we champion different causes but for me  I see commonality I think whether we're  talking about gender inequality  or racism or queer rights or indigenous  rights or animal rights we're talking  about the fight against injustice we're  talking about the fight against the  belief that one nation one people one  race one gender for one species has the  right to dominate control and use and  exploit another with impunity he also  thanked Hollywood for giving him  multiple chances I've been a scoundrel  in my life I've been selfish I've been  cruel at times hard to work with and I'm  grateful but so many of you in this room  have given me a second chance a visibly  emotional Joaquin even paid tribute to  his late brother River Phoenix when he  was 17 my brother wrote over this lyric  he said run to the rescue with love and  peace  we'll follow the passionate speech  earned him a standing ovation  of course Joaquin's Oscar is just the  icing on his award season cake he also  brought home a Golden Globe and a SAG  Award and let's not forget his wins at  the BAFTAs and Critics Choice Awards  joaquin delivered a powerful speech at  each stop touching on everything from  climate change to systemic racism oh  yeah he also wore the same suit to every  award show as an act of sustainability I  thought that it was gonna be challenging  for me as an actor I thought was gonna  be challenging for the audience and  that's exciting to me personally I'm  just super interesting about it  Phoenix is the second actor to win an  Oscar for playing the Joker  after Heath Ledger's posthumous win for  The Dark Knight in 2009  [Music]
 

